[16.65,"o","\r\n============================================================\r\n   SAIL-PROXY Docker Setup\r\n============================================================\r\n\r\nThis script will help you configure the SAP LLM Gateway\r\nfor Docker deployment, including:\r\n  - Service environment files (.env)\r\n  - Authentication providers\r\n  - Security tokens and secrets\r\n\r\n\r\n📊 Database Configuration\r\n=========================================\r\nConfigure PostgreSQL database credentials for the deployment.\r\n💡 Tip: Leave password empty to auto-generate a secure random password\r\n\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mDatabase username:\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m(admin_user) \u001b[22m\u001b[34D\u001b[34C"]
[17.881,"o","\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mDatabase username:\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[36madmin_user\u001b[39m\u001b[31D\u001b[31C\r\n\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mDatabase password (leave empty for auto-generated):\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[54D\u001b[54C"]
[19.159,"o","\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mDatabase password (leave empty for auto-generated):\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[54D\u001b[54C\r\n✅ Auto-generated secure database password\r\n\r\nSAP AI Core Configuration\r\n========================\r\n\r\n✅ Found SAP AI Core service key in environment variable SAP_AI_CORE_SERVICE_KEY\r\nExtracted configuration:\r\n  - SAP AI Core URL: https://api.ai.demo.example.com\r\n  - Auth URL: https://demo.authentication.example.com/oauth/token\r\n  - Region: demo.example\r\n\r\n🚀 Using SAP AI Core service key from environment variable\r\n   Skipping interactive configuration...\r\n\r\n\r\n============================================================\r\n   Authentication Provider Setup\r\n============================================================\r\n\r\nAvailable authentication providers:\r\n\r\n\u001b[?25l\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSelect authentication provider:\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m(Use arrow keys)\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[36m❯ Local Development (hardcoded users) - ⚠️  WARNING: Do not use in production!\u001b[39m \r\n  GitHub OAuth \r\n  LDAP/Active Directory \r\n  Okta SAML \r\n  SAP Cloud Identity Services (OpenID Connect) \r\n  ← Back \u001b[9D\u001b[9C"]
[20.443,"o","\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSelect authentication provider:\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[36mLocal Development (hardcoded users)\u001b[39m\u001b[69D\u001b[69C\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\nConfiguring Local Development (hardcoded users)...\r\n\r\n\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mLogout redirect URL\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m(auto-shell) \u001b[22m\u001b[35D\u001b[35C"]
[21.729,"o","\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mLogout redirect URL\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[36mauto-shell\u001b[39m\u001b[32D\u001b[32C\r\n\r\nDeployment configuration:\r\n\u001b[?25l\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mUse localhost for development?\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m(Use arrow keys)\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[36m❯ Yes\u001b[39m \r\n  No \r\n  ← Back \u001b[9D\u001b[9C"]
[23.015,"o","\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mUse localhost for development?\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[36mYes\u001b[39m\u001b[36D\u001b[36C\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\n============================================================\r\n   Docker Image Configuration\r\n============================================================\r\n\r\nChoose how Docker images should be managed:\r\n  • Local builds: Build images on this machine (recommended for development)\r\n  • Pull from registry: Use pre-built images from a container registry (faster startup)\r\n\r\n\u001b[?25l\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSelect image mode:\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m(Use arrow keys)\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[36m❯ Build locally (development mode)\u001b[39m \r\n  Pull from container registry (production mode) \r\n  ← Back \u001b[9D\u001b[9C"]
[24.47,"o","\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSelect image mode:\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\r\n  Build locally (development mode) \r\n\u001b[36m❯ Pull from container registry (production mode)\u001b[39m \r\n  ← Back \u001b[9D\u001b[9C"]
[24.552,"o","\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSelect image mode:\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[36mPull from container registry (production mode)\u001b[39m\u001b[67D\u001b[67C\r\n\u001b[?25h\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mContainer registry (e.g., ghcr.io, docker.io):\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m(ghcr.io) \u001b[22m\u001b[59D\u001b[59C"]
[25.84,"o","\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mContainer registry (e.g., ghcr.io, docker.io):\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[36mghcr.io\u001b[39m\u001b[56D\u001b[56C\r\n\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mRegistry organization/username:\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m(st-gr) \u001b[22m\u001b[42D\u001b[42C"]
[27.124,"o","\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mRegistry organization/username:\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[36mst-gr\u001b[39m\u001b[39D\u001b[39C\r\n\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSAP billing currency (three letters, for example USD or EUR):\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m(USD) \u001b[22m\u001b[70D\u001b[70C"]
[28.409,"o","\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSAP billing currency (three letters, for example USD or EUR):\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[36mUSD\u001b[39m\u001b[67D\u001b[67C\r\n\u001b[?25l\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mAllow admins to install plugins? An uploaded plugin runs as code inside the gateway, which holds \u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[1myour provider keys.\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m(Use arrow keys)\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[36m❯ Yes\u001b[39m \r\n  No \r\n  ← Back \u001b[9D\u001b[9C"]
[29.694,"o","\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mAllow admins to install plugins? An uploaded plugin runs as code inside the gateway, which holds \u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[1myour provider keys.\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[36mYes\u001b[39m\u001b[23D\u001b[22C\r\n\u001b[?25h"]
[29.79,"o","\r\nImages will be pulled from: ghcr.io/st-gr\r\n\u001b[?25l\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mPull Docker images now? This prevents local builds and ensures immediate startup.\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m(Use arrow keys)\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[36m❯ Yes\u001b[39m \r\n  No \r\n  ← Back \u001b[9D\u001b[9C"]
[31.031,"o","\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mPull Docker images now? This prevents local builds and ensures immediate startup.\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[36mYes\u001b[39m\u001b[87D\u001b[87C\r\n\u001b[?25h\u001b[?25l\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mReview your answers (choose one to change it)\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m(Use arrow keys)\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[36m❯ ✔ Write configuration\u001b[39m \r\n  \u001b[2m──── or change an answer ────\u001b[22m\r\n  Database username: admin_user \r\n  Database password: •••••••• (changed) \r\n  Select authentication provider: Local Development (hardcoded users) - ⚠️  WARNING: Do not use in \r\nproduction! (changed) \r\n  Logout redirect URL: auto-shell \r\n  Use localhost for development?: Yes \r\n  Select image mode: Pull from container registry (production mode) (changed) \r\n  Container registry (e.g., ghcr.io, docker.io): ghcr.io \r\n  Registry organization/username: st-gr \r\n  SAP billing currency: USD \r\n  Admins may install plugins: Yes \r\n  Pull Docker images now? This prevents local builds and ensures immediate startup.: Yes \r\n  \u001b[2m────\u001b[22m\r\n  ← Back \u001b[9D\u001b[9C"]
[32.316,"o","\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mReview your answers (choose one to change it)\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[36m✔ Write configuration\u001b[39m\u001b[69D\u001b[69C\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\nChecking service configuration files...\r\n\r\n📝 Creating Gateway .env file...\r\n✅ Gateway .env created successfully\r\n\r\n🔒 SECURITY WARNING: SAP AI Core credentials stored in .env file\r\n   For production deployments, consider using:\r\n   - OS environment variables (export CLIENT_SECRET=xxx)\r\n   - Docker secrets or Kubernetes secrets\r\n   - External secret management (HashiCorp Vault, etc.)\r\n   - Set file permissions: chmod 600 services/gateway/.env\r\n📝 Creating Admin .env file...\r\n✅ Admin .env created successfully\r\n📝 Creating Ollama .env file...\r\n✅ Ollama .env created successfully\r\n\r\n🔐 Validating shared security tokens...\r\n\r\n✅ VALIDATION_TOKEN_SECRET matches\r\n✅ METADATA_ENCRYPTION_KEY matches\r\n\r\n✅ All security tokens validated successfully\r\n\r\nConfiguring Docker image settings...\r\n✅ Created .env.docker with registry mode configuration\r\n\r\n✅ Created .env file for manual docker-compose commands\r\n\r\nCopying and configuring files...\r\n✅ Updated admin .env with ROLE_MAPPING\r\nℹ️  Nginx configuration is now handled via environment variables\r\n   See docker/nginx/README.md for details\r\n✅ .env.postgres configured\r\n✅ .env.filesearch-runtime configured\r\n✅ .env.nginx created with BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080\r\n✅ Database credentials written to docker/.env (POSTGRES_USER, POSTGRES_PASSWORD)\r\n✅ dex.config.yaml configured\r\n✅ .env.auth configured\r\n✅ Created placeholder okta-saml-ca.pem file for Dex service\r\n✅ docker/.sail-proxy-install.json records this installation\r\n\r\n============================================================\r\n   Setup Complete! 🎉\r\n============================================================\r\n\r\n✅ Configured for: Local Development (hardcoded users)\r\n✅ Base URL: http://localhost:8080\r\n"]
[32.574,"o","\r\nGenerated/Updated files:\r\n  Service Configuration:\r\n  - services/gateway/.env (SAP AI Core configuration)\r\n  - services/admin/.env (Admin service configuration)\r\n  - services/ollama/.env (Ollama service configuration)\r\n  Authentication Configuration:\r\n  - .env.nginx (Nginx environment variables)\r\n  - dex.config.yaml (with provider-specific configuration)\r\n  - .env.auth (updated OAuth2 URLs)\r\n  - .env.postgres (PostgreSQL configuration for Docker)\r\n\r\n💡 Configuration verification:\r\n   node verify-config.js\r\n\r\n✅ Nginx uses environment variables for configuration!\r\n   No rebuild required - configuration is applied at container startup.\r\n   The nginx image can be built once and reused across environments.\r\n\r\n🍎 Apple Silicon (ARM64) Detected\r\n   All services support native ARM64 for optimal performance.\r\n\r\n🐳 Registry Mode Configuration Detected\r\nImages will be pulled from: ghcr.io/st-gr\r\n\r\n\r\n🚀 Pulling Docker images from registry...\r\n"]
